Scope note — what this licence covers and does not cover:

- COVERED: the original Otxyn Motion work in this repository — the research
  documents, the library manifest and per-entry reference documents, the skill
  (SKILL.md, CRAFT.md), the website (index.html, assets/, scripts/), and the
  templates.
- NOT COVERED: third-party references cited as inspiration (their demos, source
  repositories, screenshots of their work, trademarks and names). Each third-party
  source keeps its own licence; none of them is relicensed by inclusion as a
  *reference*. Per-entry licence blocks in library/manifest.json record what may be
  adapted (MIT/Apache-2.0/CC0-verified sources only), what must be re-invented
  (unlicensed sources), and which sources are pattern-studies only. Bundled font
  families in library implementations are OFL-licensed (see manifest fonts block).
- research/previews/* contains Playwright captures of third-party demos: internal
  research evidence only, not for redistribution as standalone assets.
